3. Results and discussions
Heat transfer analysis is performed on a regenerative cooled semi-cryogenic thrust chamber burning LOX/RP-1 combination with RP-1 as the coolant. The thrust chamber material is OFHC and covering jacket material is Inconel-718. The parameters of the liquid propellant engine considered for analysis is expressed in table 1.
3.1. Effect of aspect ratio of coolant channels
